# Capacitor native project (android/) IS committed — it carries hand-made
# native customizations (network security config, manifest permissions,
# google-services.json placeholder) that `npx cap sync` won't regenerate.
# Only its generated build output/local machine config is ignored:
android/app/build/
android/build/
android/.gradle/
android/local.properties
android/captures/
android/*.keystore
android/*.jks
ios/

